<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce expects strong growth in Q4.</title>
<headline>Oce expects strong growth in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV said on Wednesday it expected for the fourth quarter a continuation of the positive development over the first nine months.</p>
<p>Oce posted a net profit of 38.9 million guilders in the third quarter versus 22.7 million guilders in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>The company previously said it expected higher net profits in the financial year to November 30, 1996, compared with last year's 108.3 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
